iv class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false"><div class=""><div class="message-in focusable-list-item _amjy _amjw x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div class="_amk4 false false _amkd _amk5 false"><span aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tail-in" class="_amk7"><svg viewBox="0 0 8 13" height="13" width="8" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" version="1.1" x="0px" y="0px" enable-background="new 0 0 8 13"><title>tail-in</title><path opacity="0.13" fill="#0000000" d="M1.533,3.568L8,12.193V1H2.812 C1.042,1,0.474,2.156,1.533,3.568z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.533,2.568L8,11.193V0L2.812,0C1.042,0,0.474,1.156,1.533,2.568z"></path></svg></span><div class="_amk6 _amlo false false"><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xf159sx xwib8y2 x7coems"><div class="_ahxj _ahxz x78zum5 x1srln1p xvwrcih" role=""><span dir="auto" aria-label="Maybe GT" class="_ahxy x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1ypdohk xt0b8zv _ao3e" style="min-height: 0px;">GT</span><span class="_ahx_" role="button">+1 (289) 556-7055</span></div><div></div><div class="_ahy1 copyable-text" data-pre-plain-text="[3:55 PM, 11/8/2025] +1 (289) 556-7055: "><div class="_akbu x6ikm8r x10wlt62"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="ltr" class="x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu _ao3e _aupe copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;"><span class="x1lliihq">I’m happy to share that I’ve recently started a new role as Senior Electrical Design Engineer, Automation at Tesla Motors in Ontario. It’s been an exciting transition, and I’m looking forward to this new chapter in my career.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">I’d also like to request the alumni database to be updated with my new professional details:
</span><span class="x1lliihq">	•	Organization: Tesla Motors
